WEBVTT

00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:02.496
Before a batch, inspect exposed account usage.

00:00:02.937 --> 00:00:06.072
After the batch, record its outcomes and current usage if

00:00:06.118 --> 00:00:06.653
visible.

00:00:07.094 --> 00:00:10.820
Dave's default reserves 25 percent and stops discretionary

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:14.814
cloud dispatch at 75 percent used; it is not a universal

00:00:14.872 --> 00:00:15.766
platform rule.

00:00:16.277 --> 00:00:18.401
Do not consume reset credits automatically.

00:00:18.575 --> 00:00:21.861
If usage cannot be checked, keep the state unknown and use

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:22.906
conservative routes.

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:27.596
A reserve exists so integration, review, safe recovery,

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:29.779
and handoff are not stranded at the end.
